{"type":"uit-contribution","plugin":"Glamaholic","kinds":["free"],"entries":[{"Original":"Folders can now be renamed through the right-click context menu.","Translated":"现在可以通过右键单击上下文菜单重新命名文件夹。","Context":"Changelog..cctor","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextUnformatted"},{"Original":"Plates and folders can now be dragged and reordered manually, and automatic sorting has been removed.","Translated":"现在可以手动拖动盘子和文件夹并重新排序，自动排序已被移除。","Context":"Changelog..cctor","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextUnformatted"},{"Original":"Improved third-party plugin support.","Translated":"改进的第三方插件支持。","Context":"Changelog..cctor","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextUnformatted"},{"Original":"Valuable dyes are now factored into the item selection process when applying plates","Translated":"现在，在应用板材时，有价值的染料将被考虑进项目选择过程中。","Context":"Changelog..cctor","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextUnformatted"},{"Original":"-Previously, the selection process was all or nothing. It will now attempt to find a match with a valuable dye, or an item with any matching dye first","Translated":"以前，选择过程要么全部要么全无。现在，它将首先尝试寻找与有价值染料匹配的物品，或与任何匹配染料匹配的物品。","Context":"Changelog..cctor","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextUnformatted"},{"Original":"Dyes on items already in the current plate will no longer be ovewritten and waste a dye","Translated":"已经在当前板上的物品上的染料将不再被覆盖，并且会浪费一种染料。","Context":"Changelog..cctor","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextUnformatted"},{"Original":"Plates should now always fully apply and refresh on first try","Translated":"盘子现在应该始终完全应用，并在首次尝试时进行刷新","Context":"Changelog..cctor","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextUnformatted"},{"Original":"The '(Dye)' suffix is now present in clipboard exports for better interop with other plugins (thanks @SubaruYashiro)","Translated":"“(Dye)” 后缀现已出现在剪贴板导出中，以更好地与其他插件互操作 (感谢 @SubaruYashiro)","Context":"Changelog..cctor","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextUnformatted"},{"Original":"Added folder selection to plate creation (thanks @firstmagic)","Translated":"为板创建添加了文件夹选择 (感谢 @firstmagic)","Context":"Changelog..cctor","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextUnformatted"},{"Original":"-'New Plate' button now allows picking a folder to create the plate in","Translated":"-‘New Plate’ 按钮现在允许选择一个文件夹来创建在","Context":"Changelog..cctor","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextUnformatted"},{"Original":"-Clipboard and EC imports now allow picking a folder to create the plate in","Translated":"-Clipboard 和 EC 导入现在允许选择一个文件夹来创建在","Context":"Changelog..cctor","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextUnformatted"},{"Original":"-TryOn/Examine dropdowns now allow picking a folder to create the plate in","Translated":"-TryOn/Examine 下拉列表现在允许选择一个文件夹来创建在","Context":"Changelog..cctor","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextUnformatted"},{"Original":"-You can now move plates into folders via the right-click context menu in the list","Translated":"您现在可以通过右键单击列表中的上下文菜单将磁盘移动到文件夹中。","Context":"Changelog..cctor","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextUnformatted"},{"Original":"Toggle visibility of the ","Translated":"切换可见性","Context":"Commands..ctor","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ CommandInfo.HelpMessage"},{"Original":" window","Translated":"窗口","Context":"Commands..ctor","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ CommandInfo.HelpMessage"},{"Original":"Unnamed Folder","Translated":"未命名文件夹","Context":"FolderNode..ctor","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Selectable"},{"Original":"Unnamed Plate","Translated":"未命名的板","Context":"PlateNode.get_Name","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Selectable"},{"O