abled, empty slots will be filled with the New Emperor set when tried on or applied to plates.","Translated":"这并不会改变魅力本身！\n\n如果启用，在尝试使用或应用于盘片时，空白槽位将被新皇设置填充。","Context":"MainInterface.DrawRightPanel","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.SetTooltip"},{"Original":"Hover to view dyes (click to copy)","Translated":"悬停查看染料 (点击复制)","Context":"MainInterface.DrawDyeListLabel","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextUnformatted"},{"Original":"Copied to clipboard!","Translated":"复制到剪贴板！","Context":"MainInterface.DrawDyeListLabel","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextUnformatted"},{"Original":"Warnings (","Translated":"警告 (","Context":"MainInterface.DrawWarnings","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.CollapsingHeader"},{"Original":"Eorzea Collection Mass Import","Translated":"鄂尔茨亚集团大规模进口","Context":"MainInterface.DrawMassImportWindow","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextUnformatted"},{"Original":"Target:","Translated":"目标：","Context":"MainInterface.DrawMassImportWindow","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextUnformatted"},{"Original":"Revert Glamourer","Translated":"恢复魅力","Context":"MainInterface.DrawMassImportWindow","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Button"},{"Original":"Importing...","Translated":"进口...","Context":"MainInterface.DrawMassImportWindow","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextUnformatted"},{"Original":"Copy an Eorzea Collection URL to import it.","Translated":"复制 Eorzea Collection URL 以导入它。","Context":"MainInterface.DrawMassImportWindow","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextUnformatted"},{"Original":"Close","Translated":"关闭","Context":"MainInterface.DrawMassImportWindow","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Button"},{"Original":"What's New in G